## Interface: 11509, 16001
## Title: Glance
## Notes: Combat awareness at a glance: compact player, pet and target bars with known damage (DoTs, cast) and recent-damage trails, an aggro count, runner and interrupt cues, debuffs, cast bars, quest progress and quick raid marks.
## Author: Researcher
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\Ability_Hunter_SniperShot
## Version: 0.67.1
## X-License: MIT
## X-Website: https://github.com/LatentRune/glance
## SavedVariables: GlanceDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: GlanceCharDB

# Load order matters: each file can use what the files above it put on `ns`, and hooks
# run in this order (see core/Hooks.lua and docs/ARCHITECTURE.md). ui/ files are listed
# in the order their parts are built and stacked; moving one can change what draws over
# what.

